      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1738816549489,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Then, obtain the access token from Salesforce using the JWT \ntoken and Org URL. After that, store the access token in the\n Secret Manager.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Then, obtain the access token from Salesforce using the JWT \ntoken and Org URL. After that, store the access token in the\n Secret Manager.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
